; High-cardinality `bar!` memory probe for Massive-style trade streams.
;
; This is deliberately separate from massive.edn. The normal Massive example
; demuxes AM / XA / CA aggregate frames that already contain bars. This file is
; for the case where raw trades arrive as JSON and monoblok builds local bars.
;
; Subjects use T.<MARKET>.<SYM> so the measurement script can scale both
; market count and symbol count:
;
;   T.M00.S00001|{"ev":"T","sym":"S00001","p":100.25,"s":10}
;
; The bar tick window is intentionally huge. The point of the probe is not
; closed-bar output; it is the long-lived in-progress bar slot allocated for
; every distinct trade subject.

(on "T.*.*"
  (when (json-get "p" payload)
    (bar! 100000000 (json-get "p" payload))))
